window.products.push({"id":597260,"name":"2 Packs Pull Out Spice Rack Organizer for Cabinet, Durable Slide Out Spice Racks Organizer, Easy to Install Spice Cabinet Organizers, 4.4''Wx10.5''Dx8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814MASQZV5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Perfect Cabinet Spice Organizer Solution】-2 pcs pull out spice rack organizer for cabinet is the perfect solution to organize your cabinet. Slide out spice rack organizers size 4.4''W x 10.5''D x 8.0''H(cabinet needs at least 12'' high), which are great for utilizing tight spaces & narrow cabinets. As a must-have for spice storage, they can hold the various size & different shapes of spices. Pull out the spcie rack, find the seasoning you want. Each tier can hold 10 small spice jars. ✅【Easy to Install Seasoning Organizer】- Sliding out seasoning organizer fits almost all cabinets. Please measure your cabinet first, it requires at least 5'' wide cabinet space. We offer a easy-to-follow instruction and a step-by-step video, just with 4 screws, and you can easily assemble this vertical & space-saving spice rack in minutes. ✅【Smooth Sliding & Elevated Guardrail】- The slide rails are designed with a ball bearings system to ensure smooth slide, so you can slide the rack with a full load of spice jars effortlessly. Full extension glides offer you easy complete access to all spices inside the kitchen upper cabinets. The spice rack has guardrails, preventing the spice jars from tipping over or drop out of the basket when you pull out the spice rack. ✅【Durable & Rust-Proof Material】- The slide rails and support tubes of DABIGE pull out spice rack for cabinet are made of premium-quality metal material, which will not deform easily, together with the spray-painted surface. And the baskets are made of ABS plastic, tough and durable, BPA free, safe and non-toxic. Effectively preventing the surface from scratching and rusting. DABIGE aims to provide perfect spice organizing solutions with a balance of innovation, aesthetics and enduring value. ✅【Customer Satisfaction Guarantee】- DABIGE pull out spice racks come with 2-tier basket that helps you organize cluttered spice bottles in a limited cabinet space. Well-organized cabinet spice rack always adds more cabinet space for you! If you have any questions about installing the rack or have any other problems, please feel free let us know. It comes with 365-day warranty for the defective parts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814MASQZV5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DABIGE","source_asin":"B0C6K1BH7D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-597260","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6K1BH7D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6K1BH7D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
