window.products.push({"id":597283,"name":"Twine Rustic Farmhouse Pig Acacia Wood Cheese Board, Natural Wood, 11\" by 9.8\", Cute Gourmet Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.71,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813Km5R5uxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Inspired by farm country, this pig is made from beautiful acacia wood and serves as a cutting or serving board. With rustic elegant character, this board is a lovely addition to any kitchen! The unique serving ware--every piece is different--gorgeously displays the age rings of the tree and makes the perfect backdrop for your cheese or hors d'oeuvres. Beautiful acacia wood board Whimsical pig shape Hand wash only 11\" by 9.8\" Non-porous and food-safe Twine brings rustic farmhouse style to your entertaining for a warm, elegant feel at every event. Transport yourself to a vineyard getaway with Twine’s country home goods and essentials.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813Km5R5uxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Twine","source_asin":"B0B72JYKWF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-597283","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B72JYKWF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B72JYKWF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":597284,"name":"Villeroy & Boch French Garden Kitchen Strainer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41QDEEC7BEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description This most popular pattern in casual dinnerware evokes a country fresh feel in this sunny and uplifting design. Creamy shades of buttery yellow and serene celadon unite the four decorated porcelain patterns in the collection. These colorful and provincial designs of fruits, lattice and flowers bring the allure of a french garden right into your home. As in all Villeroy & Boch dinnerware, French Garden is underglazed to give a soft and velvety feeling to the pieces and ensure many years of lasting beauty and durability. In addition, it is chip resistant, dishwasher, oven and microwave safe. Amazon.com Designed to evoke the charm of a French garden, the Fleurence pattern from Villeroy & Boch captures the relaxed contentment found in the French countryside. Clusters of fruit and cherry blossoms, laurel leaf rings in deep green, and bands of soft country yellow and pale celadon all combine to bring the airy garden feel inside. Subtle ridges, textured layers, and other sculptural elements add a touch of sophistication, enabling the collection to be used daily or for special occasions. A wonderful addition to the kitchen, this 2-quart enamel colander is perfect for draining pasta, washing greens, or displaying fruit. Lemons, cherries, plums, and apples decorate the outer bowl, while a band of soft country yellow, and a ring of laurel leaves, encircle the bowl and pedestal base. Standing 11 inches in diameter, including the handles, and 5-1/4 inches tall, this colander will not take up too much space in the cupboard. For best results, Villeroy & Boch recommends washing by hand. --Lea Werbel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41QDEEC7BEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Villeroy & Boch","source_asin":"B0000CGEQP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-597284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000CGEQP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000CGEQP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
