window.products.push({"id":597361,"name":"WAPEMORK Space Heater for Indoor Use - Portable Personal Electric Heaters, Small Bladeless Heater Fan with Adjustable Comfort Control Thermostat, Safe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kCc-RajSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【FEARLESS WINTER】: When winter comes, a good space heater is the key to keeping you comfortable and warm. Our compact heaters use advanced PTC ceramic heating technology to increase thermal efficiency by 80%. It heats up quickly within 3 seconds, bringing an effective heat boost. 【SAFETY AND RELIABILITY】: Overheating auto shut-off, dumping auto power off. ETL certified, V-0 flame retardant material, cutting off the possibility of fire from the source, giving you peace of mind. Reliable and safe electric heater keeps you warm all winter long and forget about the cold! 【FREE TEMPERATURE ADJUSTMENT】: WAPEMORK Portable Heater is free to customize the heating mode (Fan/Low/High) and temperature (60-99℉ switch at will). Thanks to the built-in programmable thermostat, you can maintain a constant temperature in your room. 【WIDE OSCILLATION】: Wide 60° angle oscillation for faster distribution of warm air to your room. The bladeless electric heater fan provides continuous and even warmth over a warm area of up to 20㎡. Makes everyone in the room feel comfortable on cold days. 【REMOTE CONTROL】: 6m/19.7ft long distance remote control, enjoy lazy time. The cold weather is suitable for curling up under the covers to catch up on the drama and watch the phone, infrared remote control allows you to complete the operation and control without walking around. 【MORE WARMTH, LESS NOISE】: Forget about those noisy heaters that keep you from getting a good night's sleep! Our portable electric heater uses a new shaded-pole motor with low noise and low vibration. Energy efficient and quieter than traditional ones, with a working noise as low as 40 DB. 【12-H TIMER】: No more getting up in the middle of the night! Still worried about a whole night of use resulting in a high electricity bill? Set the proper heating time from 1H to 12H. WAPEMORK indoor electric heater lets you sleep in quiet and comfortable warmth while saving electricity. 【WIDE USE】: WAPEMORK electric heater Perfect for office, living room, bedroom, bathroom and baby room. A perfect gift for friends, seniors, and couples in winter! We stand behind the excellence of our brand, and our commitment is to provide you with the best products and services!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kCc-RajSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WAPEMORK","source_asin":"B09BMWGTTR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-597361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BMWGTTR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BMWGTTR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
