window.products.push({"id":597408,"name":"Bosen's Premium Chin-Zhou Aloeswood-8\" Stick incense-100% Natural-FBU390T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f9rZ1p4ML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This incense was made of rare Malaysian premium wild aged agarwood. The smell contains an obvious stronger agarwood fragrance with a slightly sour flavor. Also this aged agarwood incense smells similar with some characteristics of Hoi-An aloeswood. This is rarely been in open market for this kind of quality aloeswood offered with such affordable price. No use of any chemical addition at all. There is no extraction of agarwood essential oil before making this incense. Raw materials are 100% natural.***Key Ingredients:+Indonesian aged Chin-Zhou aloeswood (92%, contains 1% jinko agarwood)+Machilus zuihensis Hayata powder (8%)**Please note:--For those who got used to perfumed incense with strong scent, you may not be able to feel this fully natural fragrance. We suggest to fresh your nose for a few days (in order to recover olfactory senses) before burning this incense. **This incense will smell better in cool seasons.--In the international market of raw materials, raw agarwood (Aloeswood) has become very expensive now because of its scarce. The value of agarwood (aloeswood) incense is based on its purity and smell. Agarwood incense contains stronger and sweet aroma with higher purity will be more popular and priced higher.--If you feel too smokey while burning this incense, please open window to keep the air circulation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f9rZ1p4ML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bosen Incense","source_asin":"B085JP278Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-597408","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085JP278Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085JP278Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
