window.products.push({"id":597452,"name":"Blacksail Instant Read Digital Meat Food Thermometer with Backlight for Cooking Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eg3-KpkDL._AC_.jpg","description":"Ultra-fast and accurate reading – The meat thermometer will measure your meat’s internal temperature within 4 seconds so that you don’t have to open your smoker or oven door for too long. The meat thermometer has a wide measuring range from -58℉-572℉ with resolution of 0.2℉ to make sure it will work for all cooking uses. Smart Design - Digital Meat Thermometer will automatically shut off if screen stays on for 10 minutes; Powered by CR2032 button battery (included in the package); Celsius/Fahrenheit switchable Splash proof – Our meat thermometer is IP67 water proof. It can be washed under running water without the worry of breaking it! It can also survive an accidental drop into the water so that you don’t have to baby sit it all the time! Convenient to use – It has never been easier to measure the temperature of your beloved food! The LCD screen can clearly show the temperature and with the backlight, you can read it easily under dark conditions. The holding function can hold the temperature reading when you cannot get an angle of easy reading. The meat thermometer has magnetic bar on the back, so you can just hang it on to the fridge when you are not using it. A great bottle opener and easy to store – Want to enjoy an ice cold drink while cooking? The meat thermometer has a built in bottle opener for your soda, beer or other beverages! It also has a strong magnetic bar on the back of the meat thermometer. Just place it on a metal surface when you are not using it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eg3-KpkDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blacksail","source_asin":"B07XYLHYTV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-597452","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XYLHYTV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XYLHYTV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
