window.products.push({"id":597540,"name":"Useful. It's Cast Iron Biscuit Pan - Pre-Seasoned Cast Iron Biscuit Pan for Use in Oven or On Stove for Muffins, Biscuits, Cupcakes, and More","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31gSoR04HyL._AC_.jpg","description":"Making perfect biscuits, muffins, and cupcakes with the Useful. biscuit pan with seven impressions 3 1/4\" in diameter and 1\" deep, just got easier and a lot more fun. The Useful. Cast Iron Biscuit Pan ensures your favorite baked goods cook quickly, evenly, and perfectly every time. Just spoon in your preferred biscuit batter or scoop in muffin mix, toss the pan in the oven, and get ready for warm, fresh baked goods with the unmistakable quality that comes with cast iron cooking. The Useful. Cast Iron Biscuit Pan cooks so well thanks to the unmatched heat retention of iron. The thick metal walls heat up evenly and radiate heat deep into your foods, ensuring perfect, thorough cooking whether you're baking muffins in the oven or biscuits on the stovetop. And don't be afraid to get creative with this capable pan, as it can cook a lot more than breads and pastries. Try making mini pizzas or omelets, or use the cups to cook small servings of meats or vegetables. The seven-compartment pan also makes a great serving dish for dinner or parties, useful for keeping toppings or dips separated and on lovely display. Just make sure to clean out the pan with water and a stiff brush and cloth after any use, and lightly oil it after cooking from time to time. With a little love, the Useful. will last a lifetime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31gSoR04HyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Useful.","source_asin":"B07GSJDT5L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-597540","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GSJDT5L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GSJDT5L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
