window.products.push({"id":597770,"name":"Gahiji ガヒジ Oil Sprayer for Cooking, 7Oz/200ML Olive Oil Spray Mister, Refillable Oil Spray Bottle for Air Fryer, Salad, BBQ, Kitchen Baking & Roasting","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414sSeZ4keL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"OUR OIL SPRAYER DISPENSER, YOUR HOME & KITCHEN ASSISTANT Food Grade Material: The olive oil spritzer bottle is made of food-grade PP and PET, which is completely good to body. They are simple, sturdy, and practical. Upgraded Nozzle: The mist sprayed by the new nozzle covers a large area. The atomization spray, fine mist, saves oil and leak proof. Non-slip Handle: The sturdy handle is very durable. It is comfortable to press without much effort. The handle has a non-slip pattern, which is easy to use. Larger Bottle Mouth: The bottle mouth is wide, easy to add oil and other liquids. No need to use funnel, simple operation. EASY TO USE & BEST KITCHEN TOOL Simply press the pump of a sprayer to produce a more uniform spray and control the amount of oil when cooking. The transparent bottle makes you know clearly how much oil is left. You can clean the bottle easily, just unscrew the lid and rinse it with some detergent & warm water. Perfect kitchenware tools for home & kitchen. Fill this sprayer with your favorite oils. Perfect kitchenware tools for home & kitchen. Fill this sprayer with your favorite oils, sunflower oil, vinegar, soy sauce, lemon and lime juice, sherry, or Marsala wine. Widely use when making barbecue, steak, salad; for frying, baking, roasting, air fryer, cooking, picnic, party. To fill olive oil, wine, lemon juice, vinegar, water, etc. SPECIFICATIONS Color: Black & White Material: Food-grade PET & PP Product Size: 20.5 * 6 cm Package Size: 9 * 6.5 * 21cm Capacity: 6.8 oz / 200 ml Weight: 4.9 oz / 146 g","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414sSeZ4keL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09SQCKHLK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-597770","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SQCKHLK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SQCKHLK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
