window.products.push({"id":597862,"name":"YOZEN White Double Ruffle Comforter Set Queen Size (90x90 Inch), 3 Pcs Farmhouse Vintage Comforter Set (1 Ruffled Comforter and 2 Pillowcase), Rustic ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PES2LcnbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[3 Pieces Comforter Set] YOZEN queen comforter set includes one comforter queen size 90x90 inches and two pillowcases standard size 20x26 inches (without the pillow insert). Due to vacuum packing, after you receive the comforter, you need to hang it up and pat it and wait for it to return to fluffy. Use a steam iron to remove the wrinkles created by compression. [Stylish Ruffle Design] Are you bored with other dull bedding? Try the YOZEN ruffle comforter set! The elegant double ruffle edge is classical yet reveals a modern fashion, and can become the center of your eyes whenever you see it. With selected beautiful colors and exquisite crafting, YOZEN ruffled comforter set can be adapted for any room style and crowd. Also a great choice for a budget-friendly gift to your beloved. [Premium Fabric & Filling] YOZEN all-season comforter set is made of high quality washed microfiber fabric, which is ultra soft, skin-friendly and breathable. The high-density weaving process ensures long-lasting durability. 240 GSM 3D filling is lightweight and fluffy like a cloud, warm in winter and cool in summer, achieving a perfect balance to provide your family with a comfortable sleep all year round. [Thoughtful Details] Without affecting the aesthetic of the comforter, YOZEN uses hidden stitches to fully secure the filling from moving around to ensure you get a quiet sleep all night. The 4 corner loops make the YOZEN comforter act as a duvet insert for attaching your favorite duvet cover, allowing you to change bedding styles at any time. [Easy Care to Save Time] YOZEN recommends gentle cycle machine wash separately in cold water. Sun dry or tumble dry at low heat. Only steam ironing at low heat. Whenever there is a problem, please contact us by Amazon Email and we will answer you quickly in 12 hours. Give YOZEN trust and get a better sleep experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PES2LcnbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YOZEN","source_asin":"B0BB5W43S7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-597862","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB5W43S7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB5W43S7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
